   "pattern": "(?:^|\\s{2,})Peak Energ?\\w*[ \\t]+TOUPM[ \\t]+([\\d.]+)[ \\t]+(?:[\\d.]+[ \\t]+)?(?:\\d+\\.\\d{2}(?=\\d))?(\\d+\\.\\d{2})[ \\t]+(\\d[\\d,]*\\.\\d{2})(?=\\s{2,}\\D|[ \\t]*$)",
   "collect": "sum",
   "required": false
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "standard_kwh",
    "std_inc_r",
    "std_vat_r"
   ],
   "types": [
    "number",
    "money",
    "money"
   ],
   "label": "Standard energy",
   "scope": "section:electricity",
   "pattern": "(?:^|\\s{2,})Standard(?: Ener\\w*)?[ \\t]+TOUSM[ \\t]+([\\d.]+)[ \\t]+(?:[\\d.]+[ \\t]+)?(?:\\d+\\.\\d{2}(?=\\d))?(\\d+\\.\\d{2})[ \\t]+(\\d[\\d,]*\\.\\d{2})(?=\\s{2,}\\D|[ \\t]*$)",
   "collect": "sum",
   "required": false
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "offpeak_kwh",
    "off_inc_r",
    "off_vat_r"
